    <briefdescription>
<para>Device-safe view into a flat block vector. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides mdspan-like access: operator()(I) returns a subview for block I. All blocks have the same size (nCells), so offsets are trivially I * nCells. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
